  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.39 with immutable ProGPU preview.45; consumes compact retained-picture command storage, classified transforms, pooled transient commands, retained text-position reuse, reusable immutable-image edge geometry, and validated explicit reservations without a bridge workaround; retains the typed, zero-allocation media drawing-state seam, native activation, popup-local input diagnostics, bounded render-resource ownership, and static-frame render suppression; and preserves the Windows OLE clipboard and cross-platform input, popup, theme, WPFGallery, and designer gates.",
